<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 25.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 25.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Oct 25	Oct 24	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  238.890     238.470     237.040    0.78 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  300.850     300.610     303.640   -1.00 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.890     156.825     165.490   -5.20 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.466	46.418	48.410   -4.02 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  380.740     380.100     366.280    3.95 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.940     139.815     147.886   -5.37 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.639	15.585	14.975    4.43 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  210.830     211.490     230.135   -8.39 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.864	 1.863	 1.939   -3.87 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.556	 1.554	 1.575   -1.21 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.615     189.785     206.030   -7.97 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
